{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-93461:  util-linux security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "[2.40.2-18.0.1.el10_2.20]\n- fix -d -t output regression [OLDIS-51984]\n\n[2.40.2-20]\n- libblkid: validate EBR data [CVE-2026-53615]\n\n[2.40.2-19]\n- libmount and blkid security fixes\n- libblkid: fix use-after-free in nested partition probing [CVE-2026-13595]\n- nsenter: close cgroup.procs fd after join to prevent authority leak\n  [CVE-2026-78408]\n- libmount: fix SUID bypass via LIBMOUNT_FORCE_MOUNT2 and legacy mount\n  [CVE-2026-53614]\n- libmount: TOCTOU in the mount program via ancestor directory swap on\n  target path  [CVE-2026-53613]\n- libmount: TOCTOU in the mount program when applying post-mount\n  ownership/mode changes [CVE-2026-53612]\n- libmount: restrict the mount source for non-root users [CVE-2026-78410]\n- libmount: skip post-mount hooks after a failed mount helper\n  [CVE-2026-76642]\n- loopdev: do not follow symlinks for the backing file [CVE-2026-27456]",
  "Platform": [
    "Oracle Linux 10"
